 rong> Stop describing your classes like homework. Learn how to take stand
 ard papers\, research\, or group projects and translate them into 30-seco
 nd conversational insights that prove you understand real-world policy an
 d global issues.    </p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16\,2\,0"><strong 
